WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.700
Start a drop and choose who it is for.

00:02.700 --> 00:08.700
Set a budget, then choose categories, condition, and relevant size or food preferences.

00:08.700 --> 00:19.300
Choose a Music quiz and answer preference questions.

00:19.300 --> 00:25.700
Compare sealed boxes using prices, item counts, and clues. Choose the first offer.

00:25.700 --> 00:29.000
Watch the first box open, then arrive at its sealed product cards.

00:29.000 --> 00:38.800
Reveal three items and expand the haul details.

00:38.800 --> 00:44.000
Return to compare boxes and choose a different offer.

00:44.000 --> 00:49.000
Open the second box and reveal its two products.

00:49.000 --> 00:54.970
Inspect the second haul and save the pick for this session.
